      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "WILDFIRE PANDA (2) goes very well this course and distance starting seven times for four wins and two minors. Hit the frame latest (29.88) when second at this track in a Grade 5. With a clean break looks hard to beat. KUNG FU ETHICS (7) finished second (29.56) two back at this track but out of the placings last time when 6th at Maitland. Form here at the trip sound including two wins. Yet to win out of this box but has been in the placings three times from four starts. Cannot be taken lightly. CASH KEEPING (1) held his own to the line last start and filled a minor placing, beaten only a neck (29.78) behind GYPSY IBROX at this track. Bold showing expected. TRUNKEY AVIATOR (8) has won at this course and distance, cannot be underestimated.",
